They're struggling to hide it, aren't they?
W-W-Was it really no good?

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.330
Not really, it was just...
They're struggling to hide it, aren't they?

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:34.200
Give up, it's futile.
Not really, it was just...

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:34.960
Give up, it's futile.

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.780
So you two,

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.860
what else have you done?

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:40.640
Eh?

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:41.820
What do you mean?

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:44.200
Geez, stop playing coy.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.560
I'm talking about those things.

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.490
Like <i>hugs</i> and <i>kisses!</i>

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:48.900
Hugs?

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:50.570
Kisses?

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:52.450
There's no way we'd do those!

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:53.630
We're still in high school!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.850
Wow, Onii-san's old-fashioned.

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:57.290
What era are you from?

00:19:57.290 --> 00:20:00.430
Yuuto-sama's totally clueless.

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:01.270
What a baby.

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:05.050
Are you okay with things being like this, Onee-chan?

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:07.970
Isn't there something you'd like to do with Onii-san?

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.940
Something I'd like to do with Yuuto-san?

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.560
Y-Yes, there is!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:15.020
What is it?

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:17.130
Umm... That's...

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:21.190
Truthfully, I've wanted to do this for a while now,

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.290
but doing it with Yuuto-san is...

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:26.000
I mean, if it wasn't with Yuuto-san I'd be really worried...

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.460
For crying out loud!

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:28.710
Just say it already!

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:30.390
A-All right!

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:32.040
Umm, Yuuto-san.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:32.050
Y-Yes?
Umm, Yuuto-san.

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:33.500
Y-Yes?

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.970
Let's...

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:37.770
Let's make...

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:40.050
Let's make babies together!

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:46.400
Yuuto-san, let's make babies.

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:48.430
Ha-Ha-Haruka?

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.840
O-O-O-Onee-chan?

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:52.900
D-D-Do you understand what you just said?

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:55.070
Oh dear. My, my, my.

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:56.830
Ha-Haruka-sama,

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:58.840
you've finally accepted how you really feel.

00:20:58.840 --> 00:20:59.980
I-I-I'm so...

00:21:00.770 --> 00:21:01.690
Umm...

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:05.390
Did I say something strange?

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:10.460
I was just thinking of Yuuto-san and I starting a doujin circle.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:11.370
Wha?

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.580
A doujin circle?

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:14.660
Yes.

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:16.910
Something where people with similar goals

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:19.930
gather to work on doujins together.

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:23.050
I want to try that kind of doujin circle once.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:26.350
Bu-But earlier you said you'd like to make babies.

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:28.740
I've heard that doujin circles

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:32.410
often refer to their creations as their babies.

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:38.020
Is that how they refer to them, or was I mistaken?

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:41.910
Really, Onee-chan is such an airhead.

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:45.300
Oh well, Haruka-sama's really sincere.

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:46.490
Very true.

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:57.870
But, will the circle we're starting be doing anything?

00:21:57.870 --> 00:21:58.840
Yes.

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:01.790
This year summer Comiket is in August.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:04.590
So I thought our circle could participate in that.

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:06.870
You and I together, that is.

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:08.000
Sounds good.

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:10.050
I don't know how much I'll be able to help,

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:11.590
but let's both do our best.

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:12.510
Y-Yes!

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:15.970
I'll do my best making babies with Yuuto-san!

00:22:15.970 --> 00:22:15.980
I-I really think you should stop referring to it that way.
I'll do my best making babies with Yuuto-san!

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:19.940
I-I really think you should stop referring to it that way.

00:22:28.950 --> 00:22:30.090
Umm...

00:22:30.090 --> 00:22:31.660
You don't like it?

00:22:32.450 --> 00:22:34.660
No. It makes me happy.

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:04.700
It won't just end with this

00:23:04.700 --> 00:23:11.660
At this rate, we'll have heart-fluttering repeats

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:14.120
With our goodbye technique...

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:20.000
At this rate, we'll be heroines

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:22.210
Gently, see you later

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:24.670
See you later, idiot!

00:23:24.670 --> 00:23:28.840
It may be the end, but I still want to stay in touch

00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:29.970
I'm sorry

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:34.220
We carefully utter the forbidden truth

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:37.390
Properly, consecutively, tightly, reasonably, certainly,

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:39.390
give me a love rhythm!

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:42.060
I want to see you take responsibility!

00:23:42.060 --> 00:23:46.190
I won't let it end like this

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:50.690
That unknown letter definitely contains the words "I love you"

00:23:50.690 --> 00:23:55.570
Saying goodbye isn't allowed

00:23:55.570 --> 00:24:00.240
From my heart and my lips I say thanks

00:24:00.240 --> 00:24:03.080
As a girl I was happy,

00:24:03.080 --> 00:24:05.580
despite these tears I was happy

00:24:05.580 --> 00:24:10.000
Now, smile and wipe your tears

00:24:10.000 --> 00:24:14.340
while executing this great farewell plan!

